sequenceDiagram
    actor Blind User as Blind User
    participant VH as Voice Handler
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant GPS as GPS Module
    participant Audio as Audio Engine

    Blind User-->>VH: Voice Command
    VH-->>App: Parse Command
    App-->>GPS: Request Route
    GPS-->>App: Route (Steps, Path)
    App-->>Audio: Send Next Step to TTS
    Audio-->>VH: Audio Output
    VH-->>Blind User: Listen

    loop Repeat Until Destination
        GPS-->>App: GPS Position
        App-->>GPS: Send Position
        GPS-->>App: Updated Step
        App-->>Audio: New Step to TTS
        Audio-->>VH: Audio Output
        VH-->>Blind User: Listen
    end
